{"id":"en_my-husband-replaced-me-with-an-ai-wife","title":"My Husband Replaced Me With An Ai Wife","titleEn":"My Husband Replaced Me With An Ai Wife","description":"Clara's life unravels when she finds out her husband has swapped her for an artificial version of herself. What follows is worse: her own recollections might not be genuine either. She is caught inside a covert program that manufactures, substitutes, and wipes out synthetic spouses, and through it she pieces together what really happened to her marriage—along with the identity of the woman she was designed to stand in for. To break free of Project Eternity, Clara has to bring its architects into the light and show that neither love nor human nature can be reduced to code.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/my-husband-replaced-me-with-an-ai-wife/en_US/b468ba67b12b9746/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/my-husband-replaced-me-with-an-ai-wife/en_US/b468ba67b12b9746/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Mystery","Romance","Urban","Revenge","Female","Plot Twist"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7chts0/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_my-husband-replaced-me-with-an-ai-wife_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7chts0/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-husband-replaced-me-with-an-ai-wife_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7chts0/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-husband-replaced-me-with-an-ai-wife_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7chts0/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-husba